# Local audit / scratch docs (not tracked)
.tempdoc/
AUDIT.md
# Remediation plan: enumerates not-yet-fixed findings, so it stays local. Note
# this is one file, not all of roadmap/ — that directory also holds completed,
# non-sensitive design docs that ARE tracked (e.g. postgresql-migration.md).
# Neutral cross-machine status lives in the tracked CLAUDE.md instead.
roadmap/AUDIT-REMEDIATION.md

# Local audit venv (liboqs) — never commit
backend/.venv-audit/
.venv-audit/
audit/

# CLAUDE.md is deliberately TRACKED: work is split across dev environments and
# it carries the remediation status table between them. Keep findings detail out
# of it — that belongs in the untracked AUDIT.md / roadmap/.
